I'm trying.

02:12:58.423 --> 02:13:00.950
I mean, Adam Grant is somebody who I know, we both know,

02:13:00.950 --> 02:13:03.404
and I'm trying to, he helped me out with it a little bit.

02:13:03.404 --> 02:13:06.240
My website is julielythcotthaims.com

02:13:06.240 --> 02:13:07.160
without the hyphen.

02:13:07.160 --> 02:13:08.800
And that's a great way to learn more about me.

02:13:08.800 --> 02:13:10.160
So yeah, follow me, check me out.

02:13:10.160 --> 02:13:11.730
If anything I've said resonates,

02:13:11.730 --> 02:13:14.787
I do like to interact with folks who wanna interact with me.

02:13:14.787 --> 02:13:16.616
Cool, and let's do this again sometime.

02:13:16.616 --> 02:13:17.810
I would love that.

